This version has been modified independently and is not the original or official release of Lucid Drift.

The modifications and additional contributions are the responsibility of their respective authors.

5. No False Endorsement

Redistributors must not claim or imply that their modified versions are created, maintained, approved, or officially endorsed by the original author unless explicit written permission has been obtained.

The name and identity of the original author must not be used to falsely represent the origin of a modified version.

6. Placement of Notices

The required attribution and modified-version notices must be reasonably visible and accessible to recipients.

For source code distributions, these notices must be included in the project's documentation or a NOTICE file.

For binary distributions, the notices must be included in accompanying documentation or another reasonably accessible location.

